"releaseNotes":"• Home Screen Widgets — activity rings, your logging streak, today's macros, and a Quick\n  Log widget that jumps straight into search, barcode, photo scan, or recipes\n\n  • Scan nutrition labels — point your camera at any package label and get the exact printed\n  values, processed entirely on your device\n\n  • Smarter food photo scanning — improved AI recognition with more accurate calories and\n  macros\n\n  • Progress tracking — log your weight with a spin-wheel, take private progress photos\n  (never uploaded anywhere), and watch your transformation as a day-by-day movie you can save\n   to your library (Premium)\n\n  • Water tracking — quick-add buttons right on your Nutrition tab, with goals and weekly\n  trends in Reports\n\n  • Add to multiple days — log a food to several days in one go\n\n  • Metric or Imperial — choose your units during setup or anytime in Settings\n\n  • Coach Report — export a 30-day PDF of your weight, nutrition and activity for your\n  trainer or doctor (Premium)\n\n  • Faster app launch, a redesigned onboarding, and plenty of bug fixes, including barcode\n  scanner and subscription reliability improvements", "version":"1.2", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"ActiveDay is a clean fitness calendar that helps you understand your activity day by day.\n\n  Take charge of your activity and nutrition in one private, beautifully\n  designed app. ActiveDay is a complete fitness tracker, calorie counter,\n  recipe manager, and workout log - with zero ads, zero trackers, and zero\n  backend. Everything stays on your iPhone or in your own iCloud.\n\n  WHY ACTIVEDAY\n  • All your numbers in one place: steps, calories, workouts, macros\n  • Beautiful calendar with daily, weekly, and monthly views\n  • Smart Insights that find patterns you'd miss\n  • Built-in recipe library that syncs to your devices\n  • Voice and camera food logging (powered by Apple Intelligence)\n  • 100% private - no analytics, no ads, no servers\n\n  ACTIVITY TRACKING\n  • Auto-syncs with Apple Health: steps, active calories, workouts, distance,\n    and active minutes\n  • Color-coded heatmap calendar for at-a-glance trends across months\n  • Personal Records auto-detect: longest run, fastest pace, biggest step day,\n    most active minutes, longest food-tracking streak, and more\n  • Customizable workout filters: only count the workouts that matter to you\n  • Goal completion rings and streak tracking\n\n  NUTRITION & MACROS\n  • Log meals five different ways: search, barcode scan, manual entry,\n    voice dictation, or AI camera scan\n  • Massive food database: USDA FoodData Central, OpenFoodFacts, and\n    FatSecret combined - millions of foods worldwide\n  • Full macro tracking: calories, protein, carbs, fat - per meal and per day\n  • Daily calorie goal and macro progress bars\n  • Smart portion picker - adjust servings on the fly\n  • Meal-by-meal breakdown (breakfast, lunch, dinner, snack)\n\n  RECIPE LIBRARY\n  • Build your own recipe collection with ingredients, instructions, photos,\n    and timing\n  • Dictate cooking instructions hands-free\n  • Auto-calculated per-serving nutrition for every recipe\n  • Tag, categorize, and search your recipes\n  • One-tap log a recipe to any meal with custom servings\n  • Syncs across all your devices via your own iCloud\n\n  REPORTS & INSIGHTS\n  • Daily calorie balance - eaten vs burned, at a glance\n  • 8-week nutrition trend chart, color-coded against your goal\n  • Meal distribution breakdown - see where your calories actually come from\n  • Top recipes - your most-used recipes over the last 30 days\n  • Compare any two periods side by side\n  • Smart Insights find patterns automatically\n\n  PRIVACY-FIRST DESIGN\n  • We do NOT run a backend or collect your data\n  • No analytics, no ad SDKs, no third-party trackers - ever\n  • Apple HealthKit data stays on your device, read-only\n  • Your recipes live in YOUR iCloud, not on our servers\n  • Voice and camera processing happens on-device using Apple frameworks\n\n  DESIGNED FOR iPHONE\n  • Native SwiftUI app, fast and fluid\n  • Stunning in dark mode\n  • Customizable themes (premium)\n  • Built specifically for iOS - no Electron wrappers, no web views\n\n  ACTIVEDAY PREMIUM (optional subscription)\n  Unlock the full experience:\n  • Voice food logging - say what you ate\n  • Camera food scanning - AI-powered meal recognition\n  • Smart Insights - personalized pattern detection\n  • Advanced Reports - calorie balance, meal distribution, top recipes\n  • Activity Search - find any workout fast\n  • Advanced Heatmap - multi-year activity visualization\n  • Custom Themes\n  • Priority Support\n\n  Subscriptions auto-renew unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end\n  of the current period. Manage anytime in App Store account settings.\n\n  Powered by fatsecret nutrition API (www.fatsecret.com)\n\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/active-day-privacy-policy/home", "averageUserRating":0, "trackCensoredName":"ActiveDay", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/activeday/id6769731250?uo=4", "contentAdv